      "contains_speech": true,
      "content": "Hey there! I could use a hand with an order I placed recently. I was all set to become a remote-working, mountain-hiking superstar at my parents’ place in Seattle, but now my company’s calling everyone back to the office—classic plot twist, right? \n\nI ordered some home office stuff and some hiking gear, but now I only need the hiking stuff. Is it possible to cancel just the office items and keep the hiking ones? And if so, how much would I get back? I’d love the refund to go back to my original payment method. If that’s not doable, I might need to change the shipping address to my NYC place instead. Let me know what you need from me!",
